														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-721220">
									

<p>She reminds me of one of the backup characters for Alpha Flight, Diamond Lil. Not a perfect match, of course, but close. The personality and the treatment of her are different, which I approve of. I wouldn't agree to give her to 682, though, since it might break its teeth or jaw on her and then have to adapt.</p>
<p>As an aside, if the substance in her body is analogous to diamond, the simple solution would be to set her on fire. Diamonds burn very well, thank you. Bet tasers would hurt like hell, too, considering.</p>
<p>Sure, containment of her shouldn't be a problem.</p>

